guide butler-routes-completionist/thunder-bluff-city
title Thunder Bluff
levels 3-60
zone Thunder Bluff
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Cities
coords live
version 1
keywords thunder bluff, city, completionist

# Thunder Bluff is the Horde capital on the bluffs and a hub the player
# returns to across their whole leveling life, so this route groups by rise
# and keeps every chain together. Out-of-city objectives ride in expedition
# legs grouped by destination, each with a deliberate zone-frame switch and
# a switch back. Every goto and complete below is a point from the game
# data; where the data gives no point the note says so instead of inventing
# one. Race and class gates mirror the data: only <Class> where the data
# gates class, only <Race> where it gates race, both where it gates both.
# The 46 Horde-mask quests the data leaves open to Orc, Troll and Undead
# ride ungated on race, per the Orgrimmar precedent.

step Lower Rise - hearth, flight and the arch druid
  note Set the hearth at Innkeeper Pala; the whole route returns here. Tal is the Wind Rider Master below, so the flight point is covered in the same pass.
  accept 3762 -- Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem - Innkeeper Pala; Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem waits on the Elder Rise, late
  note 3762 is Thunder Bluff's own accept of the Runetotem errand (Orgrimmar contracts Gryshka's 936 for its players); both feed the same Un'Goro Soil chain.
  accept 5926 only Druid,Tauren -- Heeding the Call - Innkeeper Pala; Turak Runetotem waits on the Elder Rise, late
  note 5926's follow-up (5922, Turak's Moonglade) stays in - turn in to Turak on the Elder Rise leg and stop there.

step Lower Rise - the stalk with the Earthmother
  accept 76156 only Tauren -- Stalk With The Earthmother - Boarton Shadetotem; Seaforium charges out of the Venture mine southeast of the Bluff
  complete 76156 only Tauren @39.44,65.82 era -- five Seaforium Mining Charges from the carts in the Venture mine for Boarton
  turnin 76156 only Tauren -- Stalk With The Earthmother - the charges to Boarton
  accept 76160 only Tauren -- Stalk With The Earthmother - Boarton Shadetotem; Windfury Cones north of the Bluff
  complete 76160 only Tauren @39.44,65.82 era -- Pine Salve: eight Windfury Cones worked with the Mortar and Pestle for Boarton
  turnin 76160 only Tauren -- Stalk With The Earthmother - the salve to Boarton
  accept 76240 only Tauren -- Stalk With The Earthmother - Boarton Shadetotem; a Raw Brilliant Smallfish, bought or caught
  complete 76240 only Tauren @39.44,65.82 era -- the Smallfish filleted with the Knife Set before Boarton
  turnin 76240 only Tauren -- Stalk With The Earthmother - the fillets to Boarton

step Lower Rise - Eylah, Eyahn and Auld
  accept 97485 -- Traditions of the Bluff - Eylah Sunhorn; herb, twig, thread, flint and tinder from the Bluff's own vendors
  note The Bundle of Herbs, Cedar Twigs, Sinew Thread, Flint and Tinder come from Nida, Nata, Mahu and Naal around the city: buy the set from the world, so this accept never wedges - check the bags on the way.
  complete 97485 -- Prepared Incense, sprinkled off Hunter's Rise for Eylah
  turnin 97485 -- Traditions of the Bluff - back to Eylah
  accept 744 -- Preparation for Ceremony - Eyahn Eagletalon; Azure and Bronze Feathers
  complete 744 @37.75,59.57 era -- six Azure Feathers and six Bronze Feathers from the bags for Eyahn
  turnin 744 -- Preparation for Ceremony - the feathers to Eyahn
  accept 1102 -- A Vengeful Fate - Auld Stonespire; Razorflank's Heart
  complete 1102 @35.97,59.92 era -- Razorflank's Heart from the bags for Auld
  turnin 1102 -- A Vengeful Fate - the heart to Auld

step Lower Rise - Orm's warrior steel
  note 1844's pre (1840, a Barrens accept) turns in just below - take it first if offered.
  accept 1844 only Warrior -- Chimaeric Horn - Orm Stonehoof; a Galvanized Horn
  complete 1844 only Warrior @38.99,55.98 era -- a Galvanized Horn from the bags for Orm
  turnin 1844 only Warrior -- Chimaeric Horn - the horn to Orm
  accept 1845 only Warrior -- Brutal Helm - Orm Stonehoof; Orm's follow-up
  turnin 1845 only Warrior -- Brutal Helm - back to Orm

step Lower Rise - the Bluff Runners
