  note 742's follow-up (6383, Senani's chain) stays out - turn in to Senani on the Ashenvale leg and stop there.
  accept 1000 -- The New Frontier - Bluff Runner Windstrider; Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem waits on the Elder Rise, late
  note 1000 is Thunder Bluff's own accept of the frontier trio (1004 and 1018 accept in the Undercity and Orgrimmar for their players).
  accept 5095 -- A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! - Bluff Runner Windstrider; High Executor Derrington waits at the Bulwark, very late
  note 5095's follow-up (5096, Derrington's chain) stays out - turn in to Derrington on the Tirisfal leg and stop there.
  accept 7492 -- Camp Mojache - Bluff Runner Windstrider; Talo Thornhoof waits in Feralas, late
  note 7492's follow-up (7489, Talo's chain) stays out - turn in to Talo on the Feralas leg and stop there.

step Lower Rise - Ahanu's leather goods
  note 6363's pre (6362, a Mulgore accept) turns in just below - take it first if offered.
