  turnin 6363 only Tauren -- Tal the Wind Rider Master - the goods to Tal
  accept 6364 only Tauren -- Return to Jahan - Tal; buy the wind rider to the Crossroads, then Jahan Hawkwing waits in the Barrens, late
  note 6364's ride is the quest working as written: fly Tal's rider to the Crossroads, then turn in to Jahan on the Barrens leg.

