  accept 7821 -- A Donation of Silk - Rumstag Proudstrider; sixty Silk Cloth
  complete 7821 @43.05,42.72 era -- sixty Silk Cloth from the bags for Rumstag
  turnin 7821 -- A Donation of Silk - the silk to Rumstag
  accept 7822 -- A Donation of Mageweave - Rumstag Proudstrider; sixty Mageweave Cloth
